&lt;h3 id="about-this-project">About this Project&lt;/h3> &lt;p>This is a full-featured studio for &lt;strong>Context Free Design Grammar (CFDG)&lt;/strong>. It allows you to create complex, recursive fractal art using a simple text-based grammar.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>The engine is written in C++ and compiled to &lt;strong>WebAssembly&lt;/strong>, providing high-performance rendering directly in your browser.&lt;/p>
